### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Urban Intersection with Distraction Risks" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasObstacle :billboard1, :trafficSign1 .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Large illuminated billboard on intersection corner" .

:trafficSign1 a :TrafficSign ;
    :description "No Entry sign on right side of road" .

:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Bright billboard may distract driver at night" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Darkness and lack of pedestrians/cyclists may lead to reduced situational awareness" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

